    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can tweak and adapt equipment on the fly.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tech_Specialist\" title=\"Tech Specialist\">Tech Specialist</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can exchange a Trait you have applied to a piece of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> for another one by spending 1 minute to make a DC 20 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check. If you succeed, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> loses the old Trait and gains a new Trait until the end of the encounter, at which point the device loses all Traits previously acquired through use of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tech_Specialist\" title=\"Tech Specialist\">Tech Specialist</a> Feat.</p>",
